cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se voce usar este projeto, cite-o assim. If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "MEOL"
abstract: >-
  Personal portfolio-allocation system for the Brazilian market in which every number carries
  its provenance. Rules live in versioned YAML, assets pass through named gates, and hypotheses
  are pre-registered with hashes before any data is touched.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Santana da Silva Junior"
    given-names: "Osvaldo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OsvaldoSantana/meol"
license:
